0 and holds a few hundred dollars on hand. Hageman has raised $2.4 million with over $1 million in outside support and no outside opposition spending.\n\nEvery major race rater — Cook, Inside Elections, Sabato, Silver Bulletin, and others — places the race in the Solid or Safe Republican column, and prediction markets give Democrats only a 1-3% chance. No general-election polling exists, so the forecast rests on the state's heavy partisan lean and the lopsided resource gap, both of which point to an easy Hageman victory.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0087, "margin": -17.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0045, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0066, "margin": -18.0}]}